{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/PrivacyManifests"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/traffluent\/privacymanifests"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"Traffluent"}],"role":"article","title":"Privacy Manifests"},"abstract":[{"text":"What each module can collect, the required-reason APIs it calls, and the privacy manifest it ships, so you can fill in your app’s own manifest and privacy labels.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/WhatGoesWhere","doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/ChangingEvents","doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/IdentifyingPeople"],"anchor":"Essentials"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Traffluent collects nothing on its own. It records only the events your app tracks and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context your app turns on: every kind of automatic instrumentation and every standard enricher is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opt in. It sends records only to the destinations your app gives a delivery, to endpoints your app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names. None of it is used for tracking as Apple defines it: no module links what it records with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other companies’ data, reads the advertising identifier, fingerprints the device, or works around"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the user’s consent or App Tracking Transparency. Every manifest declares "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyTracking"},{"type":"text","text":" as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" and lists no tracking domains."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each module that can produce data of one of Apple’s collected data types ships a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" declaring it. SwiftPM and Bazel both put it in a resource bundle named","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Traffluent_<Module>.bundle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which Xcode and rules_apple copy into your app, where Xcode’s privacy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"report finds it. A module your app doesn’t link adds nothing to the report.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Required-reason-APIs","level":3,"text":"Required-reason APIs","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No Traffluent module calls an API on Apple’s list of required-reason APIs, so every manifest’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypes"},{"type":"text","text":" is empty. The list’s categories are file timestamps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryFileTimestamp"},{"type":"text","text":"), system boot time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategorySystemBootTime"},{"type":"text","text":"), disk space"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryDiskSpace"},{"type":"text","text":"), active keyboards"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryActiveKeyboards"},{"type":"text","text":") and user defaults"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryUserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":"). The modules that come nearest:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Module"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What it calls","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Why none is a required-reason API","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"swift-system’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileDescriptor"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"open"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"read"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"write"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"seek"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resize"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"close"},{"type":"text","text":"), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fsync"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unlink"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileManager"},{"type":"text","text":"’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"createDirectory"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setAttributes"},{"type":"text","text":" (the file protection class), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"contentsOfDirectory"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isExcludedFromBackup"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It reads no file’s timestamps, size from ","type":"text"},{"code":"stat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or the volume’s free space: a segment’s size is the offset ","type":"text"},{"code":"seek","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" returns at its end, and the store bounds itself by the bytes it has written.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"FileManager.fileExists","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"Data(contentsOf:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"Data.write(to:options:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"code":"FileVersionStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"code":"ProcessInfo.performExpiringActivity","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It reads and writes the version file’s contents, never its attributes."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sysctlbyname"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hw.machine"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hw.model"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProcessInfo.operatingSystemVersion"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bundle.infoDictionary"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Locale.current"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NWPathMonitor"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identifierForVendor"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"None is on the list; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.vendorIdentifier()"},{"type":"text","text":" is declared as collected data below."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s record timestamps ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Date"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A session’s inactivity is measured between records’ wall-clock timestamps, not from the system’s uptime.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Date.now","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wall-clock time, not boot time."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"ContinuousClock","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the default clock of ","type":"text"},{"code":"batch()","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Swift runtime’s clock, which isn’t on the list."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GRDBPersistence\/documentation\/GRDBPersistence","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"GRDB","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"GRDB ships a privacy manifest of its own.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every other module calls nothing near the list. Of the packages Traffluent depends on,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"swift-system’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Stat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" API (","type":"text"},{"code":"FilePath.stat()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"FileDescriptor.stat()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"stat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"fstat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"lstat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"fstatat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"statfs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Traffluent calls none of it. If your app does, your manifest","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"declares the file timestamp or disk space reason it needs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Collected-data","level":3,"text":"Collected data","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every declaration below is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" (Traffluent links nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the user’s identity), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":", and has the one purpose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAnalytics"},{"type":"text","text":". A module declares a type only when it makes data of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that type itself; it is collected only once your app turns the module on and delivers the records"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"off the device."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Module"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Data type"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What it makes, once your app turns it on","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Device ID (","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeDeviceID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Enricher.vendorIdentifier()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the platform’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"identifierForVendor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", as a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"VendorIdentifierKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Other Diagnostic Data ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeOtherDiagnosticData"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.application()"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"device()"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"operatingSystem()"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"network()"},{"type":"text","text":": the app’s bundle identifier, version and build; the device’s model and form factor; the operating system’s name and version; and the kind of network connection."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Other Data Types (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeOtherDataTypes"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.locale()"},{"type":"text","text":": the user’s locale."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeProductInteraction"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackScreen(_:)"},{"text":"’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenViewed"},{"text":", and the events ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackOnAppear(_:)"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackOnTap(_:)"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackChange(of:_:)"},{"text":" track as the user moves through the app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/UIKitTracking\/documentation\/UIKitTracking"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Product Interaction","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The events "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIControl.track(_:for:)"},{"type":"text","text":" tracks when a control’s action fires."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AppKitTracking\/documentation\/AppKitTracking"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The events "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSControl.track(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" tracks when a control sends its action."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AutomaticScreenTracking\/documentation\/AutomaticScreenTracking","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"trackScreensAutomatically","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": a ","type":"text"},{"code":"ScreenViewed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" per screen, named after its view controller or SwiftUI view type.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AutomaticControlTracking\/documentation\/AutomaticControlTracking","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"trackControlsAutomatically","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": a ","type":"text"},{"code":"ControlActivated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" per touch that activates a control, named by its accessibility identifier, never its text.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"trackLifecycle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the app’s installs, updates (with the versions), opens, moves to the background and terminations.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Enricher.sessions(timeout:kinds:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": a random session identifier held in memory only, and "},{"code":"SessionStarted","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"SessionEnded","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with the session’s duration."}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rest ship no manifest: "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GRDBPersistence\/documentation\/GRDBPersistence","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Checksums\/documentation\/Checksums","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EventMacros\/documentation\/EventMacros","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"call a required-reason API nor make data of their own. They carry, store and send the events and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context your app and the modules above make."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Your-apps-manifest-and-privacy-labels","level":3,"text":"Your app’s manifest and privacy labels","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Traffluent’s manifests cover what its modules make. Your app’s manifest and its App Store privacy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"labels also cover what your app adds:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your events."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Each event type your app tracks is data your app collects: declare the type its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties hold (Product Interaction for taps and views, Purchase History for an order, and so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your identifiers."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" An identifier your app adds with an enricher of its own, such as an account"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier, is a User ID, linked to the user ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/IdentifyingPeople","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your destinations."}]},{"text":" Where your destinations send records decides whether the data leaves the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"device, and whether a third party receives it. If an endpoint you send to uses the data for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracking, your app’s manifest lists its domain under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyTrackingDomains"},{"text":", and your app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asks for permission through App Tracking Transparency first.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Modules you turn off.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" If your app links a module but never turns it on, it collects nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through it, and your privacy labels can leave that data out.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"references":{"doc://SwiftUITracking/documentation/SwiftUITracking":{"role":"collection","title":"SwiftUITracking","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftuitracking"},"doc://Sessions/documentation/Sessions":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/sessions","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/do